OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy,       
OL,8,Fblustery and possibly thundery,        
OL,9,Fshowers in the far south overnight.    
OL,10,FIncreasingly murky in other central    
OL,11,Fand southern areas with patchy fog and 
OL,12,Fshowery rain. Turning widely frosty    
OL,13,Ffurther north under clearing skies but 
OL,14,Fwintry showers in the far northeast.   
OL,16,GFriday:FRather cloudy in southern      
OL,17,Fareas with any showery rain gradually  
OL,18,Fdying out and brightening up in        
OL,19,Fplaces. Colder but much sunnier        
OL,20,Ffurther north with showers in the      
OL,21,Fnortheast, locally wintry.             
