OL,7,GOutlook for Saturday to Monday:FFrost  
OL,8,Fand freezing fog patches slowly        
OL,9,Flifting to leave a mainly sunny        
OL,10,FSaturday. Heavy rain and stronger      
OL,11,Fwinds in southwestern areas on Sunday, 
OL,12,Fperhaps becoming more widespread later 
OL,13,Fon Monday.                             
